# simplify's GLSL view: spirv-cross's GLSL of the module spirv-opt -O made
# and of the rewritten one, diffed.  Needs spirv-cross (glslview.needs);
# glslview_absent.ucas is the same without it.
SAT simplify n in [1, 32) nofile
```glsl
void Skip(uint n) {
    s.x = (s.x >> n) | ((s.y << 1u) << (31u - n));
    s.w >>= n;
}
```
# an ES shader comes back as ES (#version 310 es)
make it faster nofile
```glsl
#version 310 es
layout(local_size_x = 1) in;
layout(std430, binding = 0) buffer B { uint v[]; };
void main() {
    uint i = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;
    v[i] = (v[i] * 16u) / 8u + (v[i] & 255u) % 256u;
}
```
